<title>USA: Comair April load factor rises.</title>
<headline>Comair April load factor rises.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>April and Fiscal Year-to-date</p>
<p>						 1998		  1997</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  59.7		56.4</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	   148,850	   126,149</p>
<p> Available seat miles		249,365	   223,768</p>
<p>				   Calendar Year-to-date</p>
<p>						 1997		  1996</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  54.4		55.4</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	   526,051	   467,028</p>
<p> Available seat miles		966,402	   843,373</p>
<p>NOTES: Fiscal year-to-date same as one month.</p>
<p>Full company name is Comair Holdings Inc, parent company of COMAIR Inc.</p>
